   "mediaType": "CAROUSEL_ALBUM",
   "caption": "13 DNFs. 0 points. A season to forget. 😭 A battery issue ended Lance Stroll’s race in Brazil, adding another retirement to a brutal 2026 campaign. Across 20 Grands Prix, his results now read: 13 DNFs, one NC in Australia and just six classified finishes. Swipe for his season so far.",
