  {
   "id": "18390043852230348",
   "handle": "lewishamilton",
   "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DfhTm2_iOET/",
   "mediaType": "CAROUSEL_ALBUM",
   "caption": "Devastated by yesterday’s race, especially with how it ended. It started so well, but we struggled with the tyres and massive oversteer. In those conditions, it made things incredibly difficult. I pushed as hard as I could, but we just didn’t have the pace this weekend. We’ll work to understand why and come back fighting at the next race. The team worked so hard on the car all weekend and I’m grateful for every bit of that effort. Ultimately, this isn’t the race we wanted to deliver. Especially to this crowd 🇧🇷🇧🇷🇧🇷❤️‍🔥 Brasil, thank you always for the energy and support. This place holds such ",
   "takenAt": "2026-11-09T12:14:11Z",
