  {
   "id": "18120547792797520",
   "handle": "entrancef1",
   "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DfgheVmHzps/",
   "mediaType": "IMAGE",
   "caption": "Charles Leclerc loses P7 after the chequered flag. Five seconds added to his race time drop him to P8 in São Paulo, promoting Liam Lawson to seventh. The stewards ruled that Leclerc’s contact with Lawson at Turn 12 helped him close the gap and overtake five corners later. The wet conditions and minor contact were considered in the decision to impose five seconds rather than 10. Was it the right call? 👀",
   "takenAt": "2026-11-09T04:56:07Z",
   "thumbnail": "https://kwondalp.github.io/entrance-f1-data/f1/social/v1/media/18120547792797520.jpg"
